--------------------------------------------------------------------------
ATTRIBUTION — DERIVED WORK
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository builds on the official implementation of ABM:

  Bian, X., Qin, B., Xin, X., Li, J., Su, X., & Wang, Y. (2022).
  Handwritten Mathematical Expression Recognition via Attention
  Aggregation based Bi-directional Mutual Learning.
  Proceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence, 36(1).
  https://github.com/XH-B/ABM

The training loop, data pipeline and overall codebase structure derive from
that work, which is released under CC BY-NC-SA. This repository is licensed
under the same terms in accordance with the ShareAlike condition.

The contributions of this work — the multi-scale feature collection (FC)
module and the region-wise attention aggregation (RWA) module — are our own.
